description = "After escaping [PAWN_possessive] home planet, [PAWN_nameDef] fell in with a band of mercenaries. [PAWN_pronoun] fought alongside [PAWN_possessive] brothers and sisters in arms for many years.\n\nOne day, they were caught in a fight they couldn't win. Refusing to retreat, [PAWN_nameDef] was shot down by [PAWN_possessive] enemies. [PAWN_pronoun] was alarmed to awake in a heap of corpses, mysteriously unharmed."
